This repository is an independent Debian/Proxmox packaging of the
UGREEN DX/DXP LED controller.

Upstream project (protocol, kernel module, CLI, monitor scripts):
  https://github.com/miskcoo/ugreen_leds_controller
  Author: Yuhao Zhou <miskcoo@gmail.com>
  License: MIT

This repository is NOT a GitHub fork. It vendors a snapshot of the
upstream sources and adds a one-shot installer aimed at Debian-based
hosts (Proxmox VE 8 / Debian 12 and compatible).

Protocol write-up (Chinese):
  https://blog.miskcoo.com/2024/05/ugreen-dx4600-pro-led-controller

Upstream commit vendored in this tree: see UPSTREAM_COMMIT.
